 {"q": "What is Paine's main point about Isaiah 7:14?", "options": ["That Isaiah never existed", "That the sign was for King Ahaz in his own time, and has nothing to do with Jesus", "That the verse was added later", "That Matthew invented Isaiah"], "answer": 1, "why": "A historian's reading: the sign had a deadline in Ahaz's lifetime."},
 {"q": "What did Marcion propose?", "options": ["Adding books to the Bible", "That the God of the Old Testament was not the Father of Jesus, so the Old Testament should be dropped", "That the Gospels were all forgeries", "That Paul should be removed"], "answer": 1, "why": "The church rejected him and kept both Testaments."},
